{"CommitteeCode":"H46","FullName":"House Committee on Post Audit and Oversight","ShortName":"Post Audit and Oversight (H)","Description":"It shall be the duty of the committee on Post Audit and Oversight (established under Section 63 of Chapter 3 of the General Laws) to oversee the development and imple­mentation of legislative auditing programs conducted by the Legislative Post Audit and Oversight Bureau with particular emphasis on performance auditing. ","Branch":"House of Representatives","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"SenateChairperson":null,"HouseChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"JJM2","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JJM2"},"DocumentsBeforeCommittee":[],"ReportedOutDocuments":[],"Hearings":[]}